<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>QuickNotes - About</title>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>QuickNotes</h1>
    <p>Your simple and efficient note-taking app</p>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="about.html">About</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <h2>About QuickNotes</h2>
    <p>QuickNotes is a lightweight web application designed to help you capture ideas, tasks, and reminders instantly. Built for simplicity and speed, it gives you a frictionless way to stay organized without distraction.</p>

    <section>
      <h3>How to use QuickNotes</h3>
      <ol>
        <li>Open the application in your browser.</li>
        <li>Type your notes or reminders into the input field.</li>
        <li>Save your note and manage your list easily.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h3>Features</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Fast and lightweight interface</li>
        <li>Easy keyboard shortcuts for productivity</li>
        <li>Seamless access across desktop and mobile devices</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h3>Keyboard Shortcuts</h3>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Shortcut</th>
            <th>Action</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>Ctrl + N</td>
            <td>Create a new note</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>Ctrl + S</td>
            <td>Save current note</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h3>Send Feedback</h3>
      <form action="#" method="post">
        <p>
          <label for="name">Name:</label>
          <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required>
        </p>
        <p>
          <label for="email">Email:</label>
          <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required>
        </p>
        <p>
          <label for="message">Message:</label>
          <textarea id="message" name="message" required></textarea>
        </p>
        <p>
          <button type="submit">Submit</button>
        </p>
      </form>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>&copy; 2026 QuickNotes. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
